



<!-- FAQ -->
<section id="faq">
  <div class="rv">
    <h2 class="sec-title">常見問題</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-list rv">
    <div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-q"><span>活動是否免費？</span><span class="faq-plus">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner"><p>免費，限設計相關在職人士參加，報名時會進行資格審核。</p></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-q"><span>需要具備 AI 或設計軟體經驗嗎？</span><span class="faq-plus">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner"><p>無，不需要具備 AI 或設計軟體經驗</p></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-q"><span>臨時無法參加，如何取消或修改報名資料？</span><span class="faq-plus">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner"><p>報名審核通過後若需取消，請 9/3 前來信告知：<a href="mailto:hi@aiacademy.tw">hi@aiacademy.tw</a></p></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-q"><span>是否提供研習／參與證明？</span><span class="faq-plus">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner"><p>無，本次活動會後不會提供研習／參與證明。</p></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-q"><span>活動是否錄影回看？</span><span class="faq-plus">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner"><p>無，本次活動會後不會提供錄影回看。</p></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-q"><span>會後是否提供簡報？</span><span class="faq-plus">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner"><p>無，本次活動會後不會提供講者的簡報。</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
        // FAQ
    document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item').forEach(item => {
        item.querySelector('.faq-q').addEventListener('click', () => {
        const open = item.classList.contains('open');
        document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item').forEach(i => i.classList.remove('open'));
        if (!open) item.classList.add('open');
        });
    });
</script>
